WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.407
Unit fifteen. Getting Along with Others!

2
00:00:04.378 --> 00:00:08.263
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.313 --> 00:00:11.679
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.729 --> 00:00:15.817
Today we learn about Getting Along with Others. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.508 --> 00:00:20.025
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

6
00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:26.967
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

7
00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:33.833
Share. Say it with me. Share!

8
00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:41.238
Compromise. Say it with me. Compromise!

9
00:00:44.746 --> 00:00:48.229
Conflict. Say it with me. Conflict!

10
00:00:51.713 --> 00:00:55.447
Kindness. Say it with me. Kindness!

11
00:00:58.962 --> 00:01:02.412
Teamwork. Say it with me. Teamwork!

12
00:01:05.922 --> 00:01:09.689
Apology. Say it with me. Apology!

13
00:01:13.174 --> 00:01:21.645
Getting along means I respect and listen to others. When there is a conflict, we compromise and share. An apology and kindness help teamwork.

14
00:01:21.695 --> 00:01:22.930
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.369 --> 00:01:29.473
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:30.673
Share!

17
00:01:31.468 --> 00:01:36.642
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.692 --> 00:01:37.842
Teamwork!

19
00:01:38.779 --> 00:01:44.778
Did you know? Listening carefully is one of the most important skills for solving arguments!

20
00:01:44.828 --> 00:01:46.784
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.577 --> 00:01:55.358
Think and answer. How can two friends solve a disagreement?

22
00:01:55.408 --> 00:01:56.558
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.696 --> 00:02:02.387
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.437 --> 00:02:04.940
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

